GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer tokenInvalido123

### 401 - PUT /auth/yo sin header
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/yo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Nuevo Nombre" }

